a primoribus, infra a molaribus remoti.</hi></p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Leo,</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#g">der Löwe</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">le lion.</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the lion</hi></hi>.)<lb/>
