niarii</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#aq">nulli</hi>.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">1. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Novemcinctus</hi></hi>, <hi rendition="#g">der Caschicame</hi>. <hi rendition="#aq">T. zonis dor-<lb/>
