haben.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">4. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Natrix,</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#g">die Ringel</hi>-<hi rendition="#g">Natter, Schna-<lb/>
