<p rendition="#l1em">Zumahl im südlichen Deutschland. Schön orange-<lb/>
farben.</p>  <p rendition="#indent-2">8. &#x2020;. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Alburnus</hi></hi>, <hi rendition="#g">der Ukley, Lauge</hi>, <hi rendition="#g">Weiß-<lb/>
fisch</hi>. (<hi rendition="#g">Fr</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">l'able, ablette</hi></hi>. <hi rendition="#g">Engl</hi>. <hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">the bleak</hi></hi>.)<lb/>
<hi rendition="#aq">C. pinna ani rad</hi>. 20.</p>  <p rendition="#l2em"><hi rendition="#g">Bloch</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">tab</hi>. 8, <hi rendition="#aq">fig</hi>. 4.</p>  <p rendition="#l1em">So wie der folgende im mittlern Europa und<lb/>
